&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;Regulatory assets and Regulatory Liabilities include shipper imbalances, Lost And Unaccounted For Gas ("LAUF"), Annual Charges Adjustments (ACA) and excess/grossed up tax adjustments.&amp;#xa0;The regulatory asset balance totaled $127,290 in 2025 and $121,192 in 2024.&amp;#xa0;The regulatory liabilities totaled $6,861,408 in 2025 and $4,343,979 in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

