&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;The assumptions used to measure the &lt;b&gt;net periodic benefit &lt;/b&gt;cost under the Company's OPEB Plan for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024 are summarized below:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table cellpadding="0pt" cellspacing="0pt" class="finTable" style="border-collapse: collapse; margin-right: 0pt; margin-left: auto; width: 85%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: 0px;"&gt;
	
