&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;The Company determined the discount rate assumption using the Citigroup Pension Discount Curve which represents the equivalent yields on high-quality, zero-coupon bonds for specific maturities.&amp;#xa0;These rates are used to develop a single, equivalent discount rate based on the OPEB Plan's expected cash flows.&amp;#xa0;Due to the nature of the OPEB Plan as well as the limited number of participants, the Company assumed that future health care costs will increase at an annual rate of 5.0%.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

