&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif;"&gt;AlaTenn entered into transactions with BBT which were recorded to intercompany receivable and payable accounts.&amp;#xa0;Affiliates are all entities under BBT and transactions include operating expenses, corporate expenses, revenue and other capital contributions and distributions. Affiliate Transactions, net in the table above represents the net changes in the intercompany receivable and payable accounts during the year.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

