&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;AlaTenn is collecting revenues pursuant to its Rate Filing.&amp;#xa0;There are no current proceedings.&lt;/p&gt;

