&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legal Matters&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;AlaTenn is involved in various legal actions arising in the ordinary course of business.&amp;#xa0;While it is not feasible to predict the ultimate outcome of these actions, management believes that the resolution of these actions will not have a material effect, either individually or in the aggregate, on AlaTenn's financial position, results of operations or cash flows.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#xa0;Environmental Matters&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;AlaTenn is not aware of any events of non-compliance with respect to environmental matters, the effects of which could have a material effect on its financial position, results of operations or cash flows.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;"&gt;
	
