&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 27pt;"&gt;&amp;#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;"&gt;We evaluated our December 31, 2025 financial statements for subsequent events through May 26, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/p&gt;

